        <!-- Legend / notes -->
        <mxCell id="notes" value="Notes:&#10;- vm-web-dev and vm-web2-dev sit behind lb-web-dev; only vm-web-dev has the SSH NAT rule&#10;- NAT Gateway on web-subnet provides outbound internet for VMs with no public IP&#10;- vm-data-dev has no public IP; reachable only via jump through vm-web-dev&#10;- Automation Account uses a system-assigned managed identity (no stored credentials)&#10;- Monitoring and Automation resources were reconciled into Terraform via terraform import" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
